{"html": "<header class=\"spec-title-strip\">\n<div class=\"spec-title-col\">\n<div class=\"spec-family-crumb\">\n            FAMILY 14 · <span class=\"lang-zh\">2D→3D 与神经场：表示能力、投影一致性和不可辨识性</span><span class=\"lang-en\">2D-to-3D &amp; Neural Fields</span>\n</div>\n<h3 class=\"spec-model-title\" id=\"model_131_endonerf-title\">EndoNeRF</h3>\n<p class=\"spec-thesis-text lang-zh\">EndoNeRF 以时间条件 deformation MLP 把动态组织映射到 canonical NeRF，并显式利用手术器械 mask。</p>\n<p class=\"spec-thesis-en lang-en\">Reconstructs deformable soft-tissue scenes from single-viewpoint stereo robotic endoscopy by pairing a canonical static NeRF with a time-conditioned deformation field and tool occlusion masks.</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"spec-tensor-col\">\n<div class=\"tensor-row\">\n<span class=\"tensor-kicker\">INPUT DOMAIN // 输入域</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val lang-zh\">双目/视频内镜帧、相机位姿、时间戳及手术器械二值 mask</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val tensor-val-en lang-en\">Robotic stereo endoscopy video frames, estimated stereo depth maps, timestamps t, and binary surgical tool masks</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"tensor-row\">\n<span class=\"tensor-kicker\">OUTPUT TARGET // 输出目标</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val lang-zh\">动态软组织的 canonical 几何、深度和新视角内镜图像</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val tensor-val-en lang-en\">Tool-free dynamic 3D soft-tissue surface geometry, depth maps, and novel-view renderings</span>\n</div>\n</div>\n</header><div class=\"model-full-body\">\n<!-- Main Split: Original Figure Plate (Left) + Forward Computation Graph (Right) -->\n<div class=\"spec-blueprint-grid\">\n<section class=\"spec-figure-plate\">\n<div class=\"plate-header\">\n<div class=\"plate-header-left\">\n<span class=\"mono-kicker\">PRIMARY FIGURE // Figure 1 · PDF p.3</span>\n<h4 class=\"plate-title\">\n<span class=\"lang-zh\">论文原始架构图</span>\n<span class=\"lang-en\">Original Paper Architecture Diagram</span>\n</h4>\n</div>\n<div class=\"plate-header-right\">\n<a class=\"plate-source-link\" href=\"https://conferences.miccai.org/2022/papers/353-Paper1091.html\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>SOURCE PDF</span><svg class=\"ui-icon-xs\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M7 17L17 7M9 7h8v8\"></path></svg></a>\n<button class=\"plate-zoom-btn\" onclick=\"openLightbox('architecture_model_131_endonerf')\" type=\"button\"><svg class=\"ui-icon\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M15 3h6v6M9 21H3v-6M21 3l-7 7M3 21l7-7\"></path></svg><span>FULLSCREEN LIGHTBOX</span></button>\n</div>\n</div>\n<figure class=\"arch-figure-box\" onclick=\"openLightbox('architecture_model_131_endonerf')\" title=\"Click to open interactive pan &amp; zoom viewer\">\n<img alt=\"EndoNeRF original paper architecture figure, Figure 1\" class=\"arch-figure-img\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/ec8d0a4e84a315b411de.avif\"/>\n<figcaption class=\"plate-caption\">CLICK FIGURE TO OPEN INTERACTIVE PAN &amp; ZOOM VIEWER · Figure 1 · PDF p.3</figcaption>\n</figure>\n</section>\n<aside class=\"spec-circuit-panel\">\n<div class=\"circuit-header\">\n<div>\n<span class=\"mono-kicker\">COMPUTATION GRAPH // 8 STAGES</span>\n<h4 class=\"plate-title\">\n<span class=\"lang-zh\">架构前向计算节点拆解</span>\n<span class=\"lang-en\">Forward Pass Computation Nodes</span>\n</h4>\n</div>\n<div class=\"circuit-controls\">\n<button class=\"circuit-btn\" onclick=\"stepArchNode('architecture_model_131_endonerf', -1)\" title=\"Previous Stage\" type=\"button\">◁</button>\n<button class=\"circuit-btn circuit-play-btn\" data-play-id=\"architecture_model_131_endonerf\" onclick=\"toggleAutoPlayNodes('architecture_model_131_endonerf')\" title=\"Auto-Trace Computation Graph\" type=\"button\">AUTO</button>\n<button class=\"circuit-btn\" onclick=\"stepArchNode('architecture_model_131_endonerf', 1)\" title=\"Next Stage\" type=\"button\">▷</button>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"active-node-spotlight\" id=\"spotlight-architecture_model_131_endonerf\">\n<span class=\"spotlight-badge\">\n                STAGE 01 / 08 · <span class=\"lang-zh\">内镜视频/双目帧</span><span class=\"lang-en\">endoscopy</span>\n</span>\n<span class=\"spotlight-text lang-zh\">带相机 pose 与时间 t 的 RGB 观测</span>\n<span class=\"spotlight-text spotlight-text-en lang-en\">Ingests robotic stereo endoscopy video frames, estimated stereo depth maps, timestamps t, and binary surgical tool masks and prepares initial tensor representations (endoscopy).</span>\n</div>\n<ol class=\"circuit-timeline\">\n<li class=\"circuit-node active\" data-node-desc=\"带相机 pose 与时间 t 的 RGB 观测\" data-node-desc-en=\"Ingests robotic stereo endoscopy video frames, estimated stereo depth maps, timestamps t, and binary surgical tool masks and prepares initial tensor representations (endoscopy).\" data-node-idx=\"0\" data-node-name=\"内镜视频/双目帧\" data-node-name-en=\"endoscopy\" onclick=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_131_endonerf', 0)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">01</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">内镜视频/双目帧</span><span class=\"lang-en\">endoscopy</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">带相机 pose 与时间 t 的 RGB 观测</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Ingests robotic stereo endoscopy video frames, estimated stereo depth maps, timestamps t, and binary surgical tool masks and prepares initial tensor representations (endoscopy).</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"标记器械遮挡区域，避免污染组织场优化\" data-node-desc-en=\"Executes Tool masks to extract primary structural features and establish spatial/sequence encoding.\" data-node-idx=\"1\" data-node-name=\"Tool masks\" data-node-name-en=\"Tool masks\" onclick=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_131_endonerf', 1)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">02</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span>Tool masks</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">标记器械遮挡区域，避免污染组织场优化</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Executes Tool masks to extract primary structural features and establish spatial/sequence encoding.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"主要从可见组织像素采样训练射线\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs Mask-guided ray sampling within the core deformable canonical endoscopic nerf computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"2\" data-node-name=\"Mask-guided ray sampling\" data-node-name-en=\"Mask-guided ray sampling\" onclick=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_131_endonerf', 2)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">03</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span>Mask-guided ray sampling</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">主要从可见组织像素采样训练射线</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs Mask-guided ray sampling within the core deformable canonical endoscopic nerf computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"将观察时刻点 x,t 映射到共享 canonical 坐标 x+Δx(x,t)\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs Time-conditioned deformation MLP within the core deformable canonical endoscopic nerf computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"3\" data-node-name=\"Time-conditioned deformation MLP\" data-node-name-en=\"Time-conditioned deformation MLP\" onclick=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_131_endonerf', 3)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">04</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span>Time-conditioned deformation MLP</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">将观察时刻点 x,t 映射到共享 canonical 坐标 x+Δx(x,t)</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs Time-conditioned deformation MLP within the core deformable canonical endoscopic nerf computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"在规范空间预测 density 与 view-dependent color\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs Canonical NeRF within the core deformable canonical endoscopic nerf computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"4\" data-node-name=\"Canonical NeRF\" data-node-name-en=\"Canonical NeRF\" onclick=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_131_endonerf', 4)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">05</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span>Canonical NeRF</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">在规范空间预测 density 与 view-dependent color</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs Canonical NeRF within the core deformable canonical endoscopic nerf computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"沿变形后的射线积分 RGB 和 depth\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs Differentiable volume rendering within the core deformable canonical endoscopic nerf computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"5\" data-node-name=\"Differentiable volume rendering\" data-node-name-en=\"Differentiable volume rendering\" onclick=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_131_endonerf', 5)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">06</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span>Differentiable volume rendering</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">沿变形后的射线积分 RGB 和 depth</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs Differentiable volume rendering within the core deformable canonical endoscopic nerf computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"用可见组织像素和双目信息约束动态场\" data-node-desc-en=\"Applies Photometric/depth regularization to project aggregated representations toward the target task head.\" data-node-idx=\"6\" data-node-name=\"Photometric/depth regularization\" data-node-name-en=\"Photometric/depth regularization\" onclick=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_131_endonerf', 6)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">07</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span>Photometric/depth regularization</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">用可见组织像素和双目信息约束动态场</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Applies Photometric/depth regularization to project aggregated representations toward the target task head.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"生成新视角、深度和时序一致场景\" data-node-desc-en=\"Produces tool-free dynamic 3d soft-tissue surface geometry, depth maps, and novel-view renderings via dynamic reconstruction.\" data-node-idx=\"7\" data-node-name=\"动态组织重建\" data-node-name-en=\"dynamic reconstruction\" onclick=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_131_endonerf', 7)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">08</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">动态组织重建</span><span class=\"lang-en\">dynamic reconstruction</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">生成新视角、深度和时序一致场景</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Produces tool-free dynamic 3d soft-tissue surface geometry, depth maps, and novel-view renderings via dynamic reconstruction.</span></div></li>\n</ol>\n</aside>\n</div>\n<!-- Mathematical Formalism Band -->\n<section aria-label=\"EndoNeRF Mathematical Formalism\" class=\"spec-math-band\">\n<div class=\"math-meta-col\">\n<span class=\"mono-kicker\">MATHEMATICAL FORMALISM</span>\n<div class=\"math-title-text lang-zh\">核心公式 · 动态内镜场到 canonical 空间的形变与时变渲染</div>\n<div class=\"math-title-en lang-en\">Core Formalism · Time-Conditioned Deformation Field Δx(x, t) Mapping Dynamic Tissue to a Canonical NeRF + Tool-Guided Ray Sampling</div>\n</div>\n<div aria-label=\"EndoNeRF：核心公式 · 动态内镜场到 canonical 空间的形变与时变渲染\" class=\"tex-formula-vector\" role=\"img\">\n<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" data-formula-index=\"131\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"21.905401pt\" preserveaspectratio=\"xMidYMid meet\" style=\"display:block;width:auto;max-width:100%;height:auto;max-height:96px;margin:0 auto\" version=\"1.1\" viewbox=\"-69.279199 -69.011212 355.69469 21.905401\" width=\"355.69469pt\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><defs><path d=\"M5.955252-1.30023L5.7