g13-66\" y=\"-55.45706\"></use><use x=\"213.152538\" xlink:href=\"#m131_g7-186\" y=\"-55.45706\"></use><use x=\"216.968214\" xlink:href=\"#m131_g13-150\" y=\"-55.45706\"></use><use x=\"221.189001\" xlink:href=\"#m131_g13-67\" y=\"-55.45706\"></use><use x=\"224.536443\" xlink:href=\"#m131_g7-186\" y=\"-55.45706\"></use><use x=\"228.461704\" xlink:href=\"#m131_g13-50\" y=\"-55.45706\"></use><use x=\"233.677151\" xlink:href=\"#m131_g7-185\" y=\"-55.45706\"></use><use x=\"237.233811\" xlink:href=\"#m131_g13-65\" y=\"-55.45706\"></use><use x=\"242.3546\" xlink:href=\"#m131_g7-185\" y=\"-55.45706\"></use><use x=\"246.329689\" xlink:href=\"#m131_g13-66\" y=\"-55.45706\"></use><use x=\"250.454214\" xlink:href=\"#m131_g7-186\" y=\"-55.45706\"></use><use x=\"254.26989\" xlink:href=\"#m131_g13-150\" y=\"-55.45706\"></use><use x=\"258.779586\" xlink:href=\"#m131_g13-51\" y=\"-55.45706\"></use><use x=\"264.278964\" xlink:href=\"#m131_g13-150\" y=\"-55.45706\"></use><use x=\"268.49975\" xlink:href=\"#m131_g13-67\" y=\"-55.45706\"></use><use x=\"271.847192\" xlink:href=\"#m131_g7-186\" y=\"-55.45706\"></use><use x=\"277.57233\" xlink:href=\"#m131_g13-51\" y=\"-55.45706\"></use><use x=\"282.782788\" xlink:href=\"#m131_g13-66\" y=\"-55.45706\"></use></g></svg>\n</div>\n</section>\n<!-- 5-Column Swiss Specification Matrix -->\n<div class=\"spec-evo-matrix\">\n<div class=\"spec-matrix-cell spec-cell-bottleneck\"><div class=\"cell-kicker\">01 // PRIOR LIMITATION</div><div class=\"cell-zh-label lang-zh\">上一代瓶颈</div><p class=\"cell-val lang-zh\">静态 NeRF 无法处理组织形变、器械遮挡和稀疏内镜视角</p><p class=\"cell-val cell-val-en lang-en\">Robotic surgical scenes violate static NeRF assumptions due to non-rigid tissue deformation, smoke/specularities, and severe surgical instrument occlusion.</p></div><div class=\"spec-matrix-cell spec-cell-idea\"><div class=\"cell-kicker\">02 // CORE HYPOTHESIS</div><div class=\"cell-zh-label lang-zh\">核心想法</div><p class=\"cell-val lang-zh\">用可变形 NeRF 联合建模内镜场景外观、几何和手术组织动态</p><p class=\"cell-val cell-val-en lang-en\">Warp 3D points at time t via a displacement MLP Δx(x, t) into a shared canonical radiance field while masking out rays occluded by surgical instruments.</p></div><div class=\"spec-matrix-cell spec-cell-improvement\"><div class=\"cell-kicker\">03 // ARCHITECTURAL DELTA</div><div class=\"cell-zh-label lang-zh\">关键改进</div><p class=\"cell-val lang-zh\">通过时间条件形变场与遮挡掩膜合成动态手术新视角</p><p class=\"cell-val cell-val-en lang-en\">Tool-mask-guided importance ray sampling + stereo depth cue supervision + canonical-plus-deformation spatiotemporal factorization.</p></div><div class=\"spec-matrix-cell spec-cell-adaptation\"><div class=\"cell-kicker\">04 // MEDICAL TRANSLATION</div><div class=\"cell-zh-label lang-zh\">医学适配</div><p class=\"cell-val lang-zh\">用于微创手术场景重建、导航和动态视图合成</p><p class=\"cell-val cell-val-en lang-en\">Pioneered neural field 3D soft-tissue reconstruction for DaVinci robotic prostatectomy and minimally invasive surgery.</p></div><div class=\"spec-matrix-cell spec-cell-evidence\"><div class=\"cell-kicker\">05 // EVIDENCE &amp; BOUNDARY</div><div class=\"cell-zh-label lang-zh\">适用范围与证据</div><p class=\"cell-val lang-zh\">动态内镜 NeRF 早期代表；拓扑变化、镜面反射和临床标定仍困难</p><p class=\"cell-val cell-val-en lang-en\">Landmark surgical NeRF baseline; cannot handle topological tissue cutting/resection and requires minutes of offline optimization (later accelerated by EndoGaussian).</p></div>\n</div>\n<!-- 2-Column Design Principles & Medical Translation Band -->\n<div class=\"spec-dual-band\">\n<section class=\"spec-dual-col\">\n<div class=\"cell-kicker\">ARCHITECTURAL AXIOMS // 设计原理与数学机制</div>\n<ul class=\"spec-bullet-list\"><li class=\"lang-zh\">把动态手术场景分成时间形变场和共享 canonical radiance field。</li><li class=\"lang-zh\">所有时刻先逆变形到同一规范空间，再查询密度和颜色。</li><li class=\"lang-zh\">器械 mask 引导射线采样，避免把临时遮挡建模成组织。</li><li class=\"lang-en bullet-en\">Core Hypothesis: Warp 3D points at time t via a displacement MLP Δx(x, t) into a shared canonical radiance field while masking out rays occluded by surgical instruments.</li><li class=\"lang-en bullet-en\">Architectural Delta: Tool-mask-guided importance ray sampling + stereo depth cue supervision + canonical-plus-deformation spatiotemporal factorization.</li><li class=\"lang-en bullet-en\">Mathematical Formalism: Time-Conditioned Deformation Field Δx(x, t) Mapping Dynamic Tissue to a Canonical NeRF + Tool-Guided Ray Sampling.</li></ul>\n</section>\n<section class=\"spec-dual-col\">\n<div class=\"cell-kicker\">CLINICAL TRANSLATION &amp; BOUNDARIES // 医学应用与安全边界</div>\n<ul class=\"spec-bullet-list\"><li class=\"lang-zh\">可用于微创手术软组织重建、导航视图合成和动态场景分析。</li><li class=\"lang-zh\">镜面反射、烟雾、快速非刚性运动和器械 mask 误差会破坏亮度恒定与 canonical 对应假设。</li><li class=\"lang-en bullet-en\">Clinical Translation: Pioneered neural field 3D soft-tissue reconstruction for DaVinci robotic prostatectomy and minimally invasive surgery.</li><li class=\"lang-en bullet-en\">Evidence &amp; Safety Boundary: Landmark surgical NeRF baseline; cannot handle topological tissue cutting/resection and requires minutes of offline optimization (later accelerated by EndoGaussian).</li></ul>\n</section>\n</div>\n<!-- Provenance Footer Bar -->\n<footer class=\"spec-footer-bar\">\n<div class=\"spec-footer-cell\">\n<span class=\"footer-kicker\">PRIMARY LITERATURE // 原始文献</span>\n<a class=\"spec-ext-link\" href=\"https://conferences.miccai.org/2022/papers/353-Paper1091.html\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">\n<span>EndoNeRF: Neural Radiance Fields for Endoscopic View Synthesis</span><svg class=\"ui-icon-xs\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M7 17L17 7M9 7h8v8\"></path></svg>\n</a>\n</div>\n<div class=\"spec-footer-cell\">\n<span class=\"footer-kicker\">OFFICIAL IMPLEMENTATION // 开源代码</span>\n<a class=\"spec-ext-link\" href=\"https://github.com/med-air/EndoNeRF\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>作者/机构官方实现</span><svg class=\"ui-icon-xs\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M7 17L17 7M9 7h8v8\"></path></svg></a>\n</div>\n</footer>\n</div>"}